{"vid":"2EpFIhUHm28","source":"2EpFIhUHm28.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"My name is Chris and welcome to the channel. I'm here to teach you all about the skills and"},{"t":5.4,"txt":"knowledge it takes to be an instrument technician in industry today. Firstly, if you don't already"},{"t":11.5,"txt":"know, I'm going to explain what an instrumentation technician is and what it is we do."},{"t":17.9,"txt":"I've been an Instrument technician for over a decade now working in the oil and gas industry for the"},{"t":22.6,"txt":"last six years. An instrument technician generally works on automation and safety equipment within"},{"t":28.8,"txt":"industry. Industry has various types of process variables that it wishes to control. Here are the"},{"t":35,"txt":"main ones you will find. Pressure, this could be the pressure of gas within pipe work. Temperature, the"},{"t":42.4,"txt":"temperature of a reactor for example. Flow ,the flow of chemical dosing in a process plant. Level, this"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"could be the height of liquid in a vessel, and PH this could be the pH of a wastewater system"},{"t":60.1,"txt":"for example. Instrument technicians interact and work on all the equipment that measures"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"and controls these process variables, all this equipment forms part of a process control loop"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"that aims at controlling a process variable at a desired setpoint. A process control loop is made"},{"t":79.6,"txt":"up of the following parts. You have a process variable, a setpoint, sensor, logic solvers and"},{"t":88.1,"txt":"actuators. So these are all quite confusing so let's start with an example we are all familiar"},{"t":94.4,"txt":"with, a home heating system. Now this isn't exactly how all heating systems work, but it will help us"},{"t":102.3,"txt":"understand a process control loop in terms we are all familiar with. In our example of a home heating"},{"t":108.7,"txt":"system we have all the components of a process control loop, so let's start with the setpoint."},{"t":113.8,"txt":"Now this is the temperature we decide we want our rooms to be so we're nice and comfortable."},{"t":119.6,"txt":"You have the process variable, this is the actual temperature of the room at this very moment. You"},{"t":126.4,"txt":"have the sensor, in this example the thermostat of the heating system is the sensor, it senses"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"the temperature of the room and sends a signal of the current temperature to the boiler. Moving"},{"t":140.7,"txt":"on to the logic solver our boiler electronics is acting as the logic solver, now this compares the"},{"t":147.4,"txt":"setpoint, which is the temperature we want our room to be, to the process variable the actual"},{"t":153.8,"txt":"temperature of the room and the electronics then decide whether to turn the boiler on or off. We"},{"t":162.1,"txt":"also have the actuator so the actuator act to manipulate and control the process variable,"},{"t":168,"txt":"our radiators in the room are the actuators when the boiler ignites and pumps hot water"},{"t":173.4,"txt":"to the radiators, our room start to warm. So all these separate parts all work to keep the room"},{"t":179.9,"txt":"at the perfect temperature, which in essence is controlling the process variable. Now this is"},{"t":186.1,"txt":"exactly the same in industry although sometimes things are a lot more complicated. So now we know"},{"t":192.2,"txt":"what a process control loop is I'm sure you all want to know what do instrument techs do with"},{"t":197.4,"txt":"these control loops. Well there's quite a few different tasks that an instrument tech will"},{"t":201.4,"txt":"do. They will do calibration of the sensors, now this is a task that compares the sensors in the"},{"t":208.4,"txt":"processing plant against a known constant in order to ensure accuracy of the equipment."},{"t":215.5,"txt":"Instrument Techs will also perform planned maintenance, now as well as calibration this can also include"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"function testing of the equipment to make sure it's behaving as expected and hopefully prevent"},{"t":226.9,"txt":"future breakdowns. Which leads me on to repair, so when planned maintenance fails to prevent equipment"},{"t":233.6,"txt":"going wrong. Instrument technicians step in and will be tasked with the repair of the failed"},{"t":238.6,"txt":"instruments, this can often involve very skilled fault finding methods. Now as well as working on"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"process control loops, Instrument Techs also work on plant safety systems, this involves working on"},{"t":251.4,"txt":"emergency shutdown systems that automatically put the plant into a safe condition if there"},{"t":256.2,"txt":"is an emergency. On petrochemical sites there is also equipment that detects fire and gas releases."},{"t":262.1,"txt":"Instrument technicians are normally in charge of maintaining and repairing this equipment if"},{"t":268,"txt":"it goes wrong. Now there is a lot, a lot to dive into here, lots of knowledge to be learned. If"},{"t":274.8,"txt":"you wish to learn more about topics we have spoken about and much, much more, please subscribe to the"},{"t":279.2,"txt":"channel and click the notification button for great videos in the future. Thank you."}],"words":[{"t":0.06,"w":"My"},{"t":0.06,"w":"name"},{"t":0.06,"w":"is"},{"t":0.06,"w":"Chris"},{"t":0.06,"w":"and"},{"t":0.06,"w":"welcome"},{"t":0.06,"w":"to"},{"t":0.06,"w":"the"},{"t":0.06,"w":"channel."},{"t":0.06,"w":"I'm"},{"t":0.06,"w":"here"},{"t":0.06,"w":"to"},{"t":0.06,"w":"teach"},{"t":0.06,"w":"you"},{"t":0.06,"w":"all"},{"t":0.06,"w":"about"},{"t":0.06,"w":"the"},{"t":0.06,"w":"skills"},{"t":0.06,"w":"and"},{"t":5.37,"w":"knowledge"},{"t":5.37,"w":"it"},{"t":5.37,"w":"takes"},{"t":5.37,"w":"to"},{"t":5.37,"w":"be"},{"t":5.37,"w":"an"},{"t":5.37,"w":"instrument"},{"t":5.37,"w":"technician"},{"t":5.37,"w":"in"},{"t":5.37,"w":"industry"},{"t":5.37,"w":"today."},{"t":5.37,"w":"Firstly,"},{"t":5.37,"w":"if"},{"t":